notices are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.

The NVIDIA CUDA driver, CUDA Toolkit, NVRTC, cuBLASLt, cuDNN, SDK headers,
libraries, firmware, and generated vendor binaries are NVIDIA materials governed
by their respective NVIDIA licenses. Zed must not redistribute the NVIDIA display
driver. No CUDA Toolkit, cuBLASLt, cuDNN, PTX, or binary runtime payload is included
in this foundation package: redistribution requires a separately recorded legal
approval and exact allowlisted digests.

Reviewed declaration provenance:
- NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 12.2.2 Driver API and NVRTC documentation.
- NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 12.2.2 redistribution manifest: NVRTC 12.2.140 and
  cuBLASLt 12.2.5.6.
- NVIDIA cuDNN 9.0.0.312 CUDA 12 documentation and redistribution manifest.

The reviewed raw-header ledger pins cuda.h and nvrtc.h from the official CUDA
12.2.140 redistributable archives, cublasLt.h from the official cuBLAS
12.2.5.6 archive, and the versioned cudnn_v9.h, cudnn_graph_v9.h, and
cudnn_version_v9.h files from the official cuDNN 9.0.0.312 CUDA 12 archive.
The unversioned cudnn.h archive entry is a symbolic link and is deliberately not
treated as immutable regular-file evidence.

The package signature covers only Zed-owned metadata. It does not certify an SDK,
driver, library, PTX image, device, or runtime version. The runtime must compare
exact immutable library bytes and the complete reviewed symbol contract through
comfy_runtime::NativeFfiRegistry before the unsafe loader can run.
